WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:11.850
It is possible to win a game of chess in just
two moves.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:17.720
A reservoir of water was discovered 400 miles
beneath the Earth's surface that contains

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.500
three times as much water as all the oceans
put together.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.840
The number of Crayola colours available doubles
every 28 years.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:34.570
During the California gold rush, water cost
more than gold.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:39.980
Charles Darwin's last book was called The
Formation of Vegetable Mould through the Action

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:44.539
of Worms.
When he enlisted in the army, J. R. R. Tolkien's

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:50.020
son Michael put down his father's profession
as 'Wizard'.

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:56.160
If Bill Gates gave his entire fortune to the
US government, it would only cover the national

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:03.140
deficit for 15 days.
1 in 10 Icelanders will publish a book at

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:10.011
some time in their life.
Paganini was the fastest violinist ever. He

00:01:10.011 --> 00:01:17.090
was recorded playing 12 notes per second.
Spraying dirty clothes with vodka makes them

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:22.380
smell better because vodka kills the odor-causing
bacteria.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:27.100
The world's oldest rose bush is 1,000 years
old.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:33.170
The hairy frog, often called the “Horror
Frog” has a unique defence system. When

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:40.540
threatened it breaks bones in its toes and
forces them through its skin to create claws.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:45.040
The Lord of the Rings holds the record for
the greatest number of false feet used in

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:53.970
a single movie: 60,000.
There are currently 1,397 known asteroids

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:59.400
capable of causing 'major devastation' if
they hit the Earth.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:08.989
There are 177,147 ways to tie a tie.
A group of hackers once took down Papa John's

00:02:08.989 --> 00:02:15.050
website because their pizza was late.

